  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Basic Education</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Educaci&#xf3;n B&#xe1;sica</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Improve early childhood education, primary education, and secondary education, delivered in formal or non-formal settings. It includes literacy, numeracy, and other basic skills programs for youth and adults.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">Mejorar la educaci&#xf3;n de la primera infancia, la educaci&#xf3;n primaria y la educaci&#xf3;n secundaria, impartidas en entornos formales o no formales. Incluye programas de alfabetizaci&#xf3;n, aritm&#xe9;tica y otras habilidades b&#xe1;sicas para j&#xf3;venes y adultos.</narrative>
  </description>
